  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Government of Zambia&#x2013;UN Joint Programme on Social Protection Phase III (UNJPSP-III)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase-III of the UNJPSP, guided by the Revised National Social Protection Policy (2025) 
UNICEF, FAO and WFP will provide technical assistance to GRZ for a period of three years. 
Spanning across three pillars, this assistance has been designed to improve both the 
protective and promotive functions of social protection in the country, including for 
marginalized groups. While consolidating the gains achieved in Phase I and II, particularly on 
integrated systems and equity considerations, new areas such as lifecycle-based social 
protection, anticipatory action and climate-smart linkages will also be supported in this third 
phase of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
